# Where each release is mirrored on Docker Hub (ADR-0097), read by
# deploy/images/release-images.sh and scripts/dockerhub.ts. The repositories are
# <namespace>/<prefix>api, <namespace>/<prefix>web and <namespace>/nautelle
# (the all-in-one image). The environment variable of the same name wins.
# Moving to an organization `nautelle` is: DOCKERHUB_NAMESPACE=nautelle and an
# empty DOCKERHUB_REPO_PREFIX, giving nautelle/api, nautelle/web and
# nautelle/nautelle.
DOCKERHUB_NAMESPACE=abegma
DOCKERHUB_REPO_PREFIX=nautelle-
